<title>USA: HFS board oks buyback up to 2.6 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>HFS board oks buyback up to 2.6 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc said on Tuesday its board authorized a plan to increase its share repurchase program up to 2.6 million common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it acquired about 500,00 shares in 1996 at a combined price of about $30 million.</p>
<p>HFS said it would make the purchases from time to time in the open market or in private deals subject to prevailing market conditions.</p>
</text>
